WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.050
The micro:bit runs blocks in order, from top to bottom.

2
00:00:04.979 --> 00:00:09.254
on start runs its blocks once, when the micro:bit switches on.

3
00:00:11.876 --> 00:00:15.251
First the word scrolls, then the face, then the tick.

4
00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:20.155
The last picture stays on, because nothing comes after it.
